@host = https://localhost:7286

### Реєстрація
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "anna", "password": "Passw0rd123" }

### Вхід
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Хто я
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer token

### Список користувачів
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer token

### Створити об'єкт
POST {{host}}/api/objects
Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "M92", "commonName": "Кульове скупчення в Геркулесі", "type": "GlobularCluster", "rightAscensionHours": 17.2853, "declinationDegrees": 43.1359, "magnitude": 6.3 }

### Створити запис (M31 у Києві)
POST {{host}}/api/observations
Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "celestialObjectId": 11, "locationId": 1, "observedAtUtc": "2026-11-14T20:30:00Z", "notes": "Добре видно", "userId": 1 }

### Мої записи
GET {{host}}/api/observations
Authorization: Bearer token

### Запис за id
GET {{host}}/api/observations/1
Authorization: Bearer token